    <h4 style="margin:0;line-height: .5em;">Evaluation year: 1986</h4>
    <h4 style="margin-bottom: 0; line-height: .5em;"><div class="row"><div class="col-sm-2" style="white-space:nowrap;">ADI:</div><div class="col-sm-8" style="line-height:normal;">NOT SPECIFIED</div></div></h4>







<div class="row"><div class="col-sm-2" style="white-space:nowrap;">Meeting:</div><div class="col-sm-8" style="line-height:normal;">30</div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="col-sm-2" style="white-space:nowrap;">Specs Code:</div><div class="col-sm-8" style="line-height:normal;">R</div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="col-sm-2" style="white-space:nowrap;">Report:&nbsp;</div><div class="col-md-8"><a href="http://apps.who.int/iris/bitstream/10665/41306/1/WHO_TRS_751.pdf">TRS 751-JECFA 30/27</a></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="col-sm-2" style="white-space:nowrap;">Tox Monograph:&nbsp;</div><div class="col-md-8"><a href="http://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jecmono/v21je12.htm">FAS 21-JECFA 30/143</a></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="col-sm-2" style="white-space:nowrap;">Specification:&nbsp;</div><div class="col-md-8"><a href="https://www.fao.org/food/food-safety-quality/scientific-advice/jecfa/jecfa-additives/en/">FAO Combined Compendium of Food Additive Specifications</a></div></div>





                                                                                                <div class="row"><div class=" col-sm-2" style="white-space:nowrap;">Previous Years:</div><div class="col-sm-8" title="1986, FNP 37-JECFA 30/125. R; COMPENDIUM/1475
